<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Plastall to change name from April 7.</title>
<headline>Plastall to change name from April 7.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Packaging and print firm Plastall Ltd said on Wednesday that shareholders had approved changing the company's name to Gundle Ltd and the change would take effect from April 7.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
